<translation translation="My father spoke and said to the brothers, “I say to you, behold, for fifty-four years, from the day when my head was shaved on the mountain by my beloved father Apa Hyperichos, until now, a single loaf and a pint of water every forty days is what was appointed for me by God. I don’t know where they come from.”">
